<title>UK: FKI half year profits surge 30.5 percent.</title>
<headline>FKI half year profits surge 30.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended 30 September</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		6.11		   vs 5.20</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.1*		   vs 2.2</p>
<p> Pretax		    51.4		    vs 39.4</p>
<p> Turnover		 458.9		    vs 429.2</p>
<p>*NOTE - The 1996 interim dividend is to be paid as a foreign income dividend on which shareholders are not entitled to a tax credit.</p>
</text>
